    <string name="wizard_vr_intro_title">Cardboard VR calibration</string>
    <string name="wizard_vr_intro_text">Insert the phone into the headset and put it on. Use a remote, a gamepad or touch. On every step read the instructions first, then press “Adjust” and pick the value while looking through the headset.</string>
    <string name="wizard_vr_ipd_title">Screen separation</string>
    <string name="wizard_vr_ipd_text">Each eye sees a crosshair with rings. Change the separation until the two crosshairs merge into one sharp crosshair without doubling.</string>
    <string name="wizard_vr_distortion_title">Lens distortion</string>
    <string name="wizard_vr_distortion_text">Grid lines must stay straight up to the edges. Change K1 (main distortion) until the lines near the edges are straight, K2 fine-tunes the far edges.</string>
    <string name="wizard_vr_scale_title">Scale</string>
    <string name="wizard_vr_scale_text">A yellow frame with red corners runs along the picture edge. Pick the scale so that the whole frame is visible right at the border of your field of view, without black corners and without cropping.</string>
